AI-Powered Resume Analyzer & Job Match Recommendation System

📌 Project Overview

This AI-powered Resume Analyzer & Job Match Recommendation System utilizes Natural Language Processing (NLP) and Machine Learning to parse resumes, extract relevant skills, and match candidates with the best-fitting job opportunities based on job descriptions.

The system applies advanced text processing techniques like TF-IDF vectorization and cosine similarity to assess the alignment between resumes and job postings, generating a ranking of candidates based on their skill relevance.

🚀 Features

Resume Parsing: Extracts key details from resumes, such as skills, education, experience, and more.

Skill Extraction: Identifies important technical and soft skills.

Job Matching: Uses machine learning to compute similarity scores between resumes and job descriptions.

Visualization: Generates insightful data visualizations for match score distributions.

Automated Reporting: Generates PDF reports for easy review.

🛠️ Technologies Used

Python

Pandas & NumPy (Data Processing)

NLTK & SpaCy (NLP Processing)

TF-IDF & Cosine Similarity (Skill Matching)

Matplotlib & Seaborn (Data Visualization)

FPDF (PDF Report Generation)


📊 How It Works

Load and Clean Data: Preprocess resumes and job descriptions.

Extract Skills: Identify relevant skills using NLP.

Match Jobs: Use TF-IDF vectorization to find the best matches.

Rank Candidates: Sort resumes based on similarity scores.

Generate Reports: Create visual insights and PDF reports.

📌 Results & Insights

The system successfully identifies top candidates based on skill alignment.

Visualizations help in understanding job market trends and skill gaps.

Automated ranking improves the recruitment process efficiency.

🏆 Future Enhancements

Deep Learning Models: Improve skill matching accuracy.

Resume Formatting Recommendations: Provide feedback on resume structure.

Web Interface: Build a UI for seamless user interaction.

